        "original_id": "71b1d90c-4e7f-571c-aa74-6d0af6051e29",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sophia Petrillo, Bea Arthur, Estelle Getty\n- Roles: Dorothy Zbornak\n- TV Shows: The Golden Girls, The Golden Palace, Empty Nest\n- Awards: Emmy Award, Golden Globe Award\n\nFacts:\n- Bea Arthur was born as Bernice Frankel on May 13, 1922, and she was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist.\n- Estelle Getty was best known for playing Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Girls from 1985 to 1992.\n- Estelle Getty won an Emmy Award and a Golden Globe Award for her role as Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Girls.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Palace from 1992 to 1993.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on Empty Nest from 1993 to 1995.\n- Bea Arthur played Dorothy Zbornak, who was Sophia Petrillo's daughter, on The Golden Girls.\n- In real life, Bea Arthur was one year older than Estelle Getty.\n- Bea Arthur died on April 25, 2009.",
